 report high dpi coordin scale upstream block owner diana document key doc 2049 last updat 2026 09 10 current status block t036 is block on that upstream librari issu local coordin work remain depend on t023 s overlay path but can not clear the gate until upstream scale is correct or an accept local remedi is chosen status block on upstream render librari scale math\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9c0f8ee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"id\": \"e9d46560d0ce6c2f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3186300991073764, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15253905872482343, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70617586, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9c0f8ee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 808, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:25\", \"token_count\": 306, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Background: Path Fix Cleared Packaging\\n\\nBackslash path-handling defects that previously broke Windows builds were fixed on 2026-08-10, and a Windows build artifact was successfully produced by 2026-08-12. Packaging itself is no longer the blocker.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Current Blocker: Missing Code-Signing Certificate\\n\\nThe produced build artifact is unsigned, which triggers a SmartScreen warning and Defender flagging the binary as untrusted.\\n\\n- **Impact**: Site IT policies commonly block execution of unsigned/SmartScreen-flagged binaries outright, which would prevent installation on target deployment workstations without a manual security-policy override.\\n\\n- **Root Cause**: No code-signing certificate has been procured or configured in the Windows build pipeline yet.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-39\\n\\n# Compatibility Audit: Windows Build Signing Gap\\n\\n**Owner**: Evan\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2039\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02\\n\\n## Path to Resolution\\n\\nProcuring a code-signing certificate and wiring signing into the release build step is the only remaining item before this clears the T029 Windows compatibility gate — and, by extension, the T011 release checklist, which is holding on this exact signing gap alongside the T005 image slim-down.\\n\\n*Audit Status*: Active. Build produces successfully; signing certificate procurement is the sole open blocker.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 background path fix clear packag backslash path handl defect that previous broke window build were fix on 2026 08 10 and a window build artifact wa success produc by 2026 08 12 packag itself is no longer the blocker sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 current blocker miss code sign certif the produc build artifact is unsign which trigger a smartscreen warn and defend flag the binari a untrust impact site it polici common block execut of unsign smartscreen flag binari outright which would prevent instal on target deploy workstat without a manual secur polici overrid root caus no code sign certif ha been procur or configur in the window build pipelin yet sourc id src gdoc 39 compat audit window build sign gap owner evan document key doc 2039 last updat 2026 09 02 path to resolut procur a code sign certif and wire sign into the releas build step is the onli remain item befor this clear the t029 window compat gate and by extens the t011 releas checklist which is hold on this exact sign gap alongsid the t005 imag slim down audit status activ build produc success sign certif procur is the sole open blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9aa652a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"7d9dbdfb5b6d7c2f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31743513826736874, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1399567103819554, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73155147, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9aa652a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-Windows-Compatibility-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1340, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:48\", \"token_count\": 387, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {